oscar-transformers
==================

A port of the OSCAR (Offline Spectral Covariance-Aware Rotation) 2-bit KV cache
quantization algorithm into the `transformers.cache_utils.Cache` API surface so
it can be used with stock Hugging Face transformers models without depending on
SGLang.

Upstream
--------

The algorithm, the offline 3-phase calibration pipeline, the rotation file
format, and the INT2 attention kernel come from:

  OSCAR: Offline Spectral Covariance-Aware Rotation for 2-bit KV Cache
  Quantization
  Paper:   https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.17757
  Code:    https://github.com/FutureMLS-Lab/OSCAR  (MIT)
  Website: https://oscar-quantize.github.io/
  Rotations (RotationZoo): https://huggingface.co/Zhongzhu/OSCAR-RotationZoo

This package is an independent re-implementation of the OSCAR math against the
Hugging Face transformers `Cache` API; it does not vendor any code from the
upstream repository. Credit for the algorithm and the calibrated rotation
matrices belongs to the OSCAR authors. This port is released under the MIT
license; see LICENSE.
